[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0392","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0392","title":"Thomas Boutell cgic库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Thomas Boutell开发的CGIC CGI库1.05及之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向CGI程序发送特制输入触发溢出，可能导致敏感信息泄露或服务异常。攻击无需认证，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0392"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-01-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级cgic库至1.05之后的版本（如2.x系列），避免使用存在缓冲区溢出漏洞的旧版本。审查并修复所有基于cgic库开发的CGI程序中的输入边界检查逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0392","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0392"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0392.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0392.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0680","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0680.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0442","title":"Sun Solaris 7.0 ff.core 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 系统中的 ff.core 工具存在本地权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过利用 ff.core 对文件的不当权限处理机制，以提升后的权限修改系统文件或用户文件。该漏洞影响 Sun Solaris 7.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0442"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-01-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:24Z","remediation":"升级到 Oracle Solaris 11 或更高版本（Solaris 7 已于 2008 年停止支持，不再提供安全补丁）。如无法升级，立即移除 ff.core 文件的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/ff.core），并限制可登录系统的用户范围为受信管理员，以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/327","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19258","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/727cf5277c8c23eaf8725829e26aff2ea619a86c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0442.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0442","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0442.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/77fd3cf167afc5c82646a191836bcd2f9e51b459/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0442.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-48x7-62gq-cjp3/GHSA-48x7-62gq-cjp3.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0442.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fdbfe09c-950c-40c3-9984-4bb5f6692a41.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0680.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1437","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1437.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1268","title":"KDE konsole 本地会话劫持漏洞","description":"KDE konsole 终端模拟器存在权限检查缺陷，本地攻击者可通过访问其他用户正在使用的终端设备文件（如伪终端设备），劫持或窥探其会话内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 KDE konsole 早期版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1268"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-06T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:04Z","remediation":"升级 KDE konsole 到包含 TIOCSPTLCK 锁补丁的版本（1999 年后的 KDE 1.x 及以上版本均已修复）；如无法升级，确保系统 umask 为 077 且 /dev/pts/* 设备权限为 600，同时建议使用 `mesg n` 禁止其他用户写入当前终端，并通过内核参数 `kernel.yama.ptrace_scope=1` 限制进程间追踪。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.kde.org/?l=kde-devel&m=91560433413263&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1645","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1268.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1268","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1268.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1268.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ggrx-fw3j-gvr2/GHSA-ggrx-fw3j-gvr2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87848/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1268.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000488.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1437.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1437.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0696","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0696.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0458","title":"L0phtcrack 临时文件密码信息泄露漏洞","description":"L0phtcrack 2.5 在 Windows 系统临时目录（TEMP）中存储临时文件，这些文件可能包含明文密码信息。本地攻击者若能够访问目标系统的临时目录，可读取这些未清理的临时文件，从而窃取用户的密码凭据。该漏洞影响 L0phtcrack 2.5 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，攻击前提是攻击者已获得本地文件系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0458"],"sources":["avd","cve"],"published":"1999-01-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 L0phtcrack 至不受影响的版本，新版已在内存中处理密码哈希而非写入临时文件。同时应确保系统 TEMP 目录配置正确的 NTFS 权限（仅允许当前用户访问），并定期清理临时目录中残留的敏感文件。在组策略中启用登录时清空临时文件夹功能可作为纵深防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0458","http://www.osvdb.org/915"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0696.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0628","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0628.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0391","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98 SMB 认证重放漏洞","description":"Windows 95 和 Windows 98 的 SMB 认证机制存在加密挑战值可被重用的安全漏洞。远程攻击者通过捕获并重放合法的 SMB 认证响应数据包，可在未持有用户密码的情况下冒充合法用户身份访问共享资源。该漏洞源于 SMB 协议在认证过程中未对挑战值（challenge）实施一次性使用机制，导致同一挑战值可被多次使用。受影响系统包括 Windows 95、Windows 98、Windows NT、Terminal Server 及 Windows 2000，攻击者需处于同一网络段以嗅探认证流量。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0391"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:17Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Windows 95/98 系统，Microsoft 未发布官方补丁。建议立即升级至 Windows 10 或 Windows 11 等受支持版本；如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙禁用 SMB 协议（TCP 139/445 端口）作为临时缓解措施，并限制局域网内不可信设备的接入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91552769809542&w=2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0391.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6df16fc0c02ccadd2d0fbb0029e3db345d75f1c8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0391.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0391","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ec31d5593e31331ed2058e001803e087d65aa416/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0391.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0391.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9xx2-9vgq-cg78/GHSA-9xx2-9vgq-cg78.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8bd1c345-0c25-41c6-b5b4-133fdc5ef13a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0391.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0628.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0719","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0719.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0464","title":"Tripwire Tripwire 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Tripwire 1.2 及更早版本在处理文件系统扫描时未能正确校验文件名长度，本地攻击者可通过创建包含超长文件名的恶意文件触发缓冲区相关问题，导致 Tripwire 程序崩溃或进入异常状态，从而无法完成完整性检测任务。该漏洞需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，利用门槛较低，但影响范围仅限于 Tripwire 1.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0464"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:27Z","remediation":"建议将 Tripwire 1.2 源码中 src/utils.c 第 387 和 408 行的指针声明从 `char *` 改为 `unsigned char *`，并将 `octal_array` 从 127 个元素扩展到 255 个元素（补丁来自 Bugtraq 公告），重新编译后部署。如无法打补丁，可升级到 Red Hat 提供的已修复版本或使用 AIDE 等现代替代工具。临时缓解措施为限制普通用户在 Tripwire 监控目录中创建超长文件名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91553066310826&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91592136122066&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/6609"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0719.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0626","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0390","title":"SUSE Linux 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>CVE-1999-0390 是 Dosemu（DOS 模拟器）所依赖的 Slang 终端处理库中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。拥有本地系统访问权限的攻击者可向 Dosemu 提交恶意的构造输入，触发 Slang 库在处理数据时发生缓冲区溢出，造成内存损坏。由于 Dosemu 以 setuid root 权限运行，成功利用此漏洞的本地攻击者能够获得 root 级特权，从而完全控制受影响系统，实现机密性、完整性和可用性的全面沦陷。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux、Caldera OpenLinux 等多种 Linux 发行版，CVSS v2.0 评分为 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0390"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-01-04T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议将 dosemu 升级至包含 Slang 库缓冲区溢出修复的版本（Caldera OpenLinux 用户应用 CSSA-1999-006.1 补丁）。Red Hat Linux 用户应升级至 dosemu 0.99.10 或更高版本。如无法升级，可移除或禁用 dosemu 的 setuid 位以缓解提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0626.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1219","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0914","title":"Debian GNU/Linux netstd FTP客户端缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 的 netstd 软件包中的 FTP 客户端存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 FTP 客户端接收到超长或特制的服务器响应时，由于缺乏正确的边界检查，可触发缓冲区溢出。攻击者可通过搭建恶意 FTP 服务器并诱导用户连接，导致客户端崩溃或实现以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Debian 2.0 及早期版本系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0914"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-01-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 netstd 软件包至包含补丁的最新版本，或使用更安全的替代方案如 openssh sftp/scp。避免使用 FTP 客户端连接不可信的 FTP 服务器，限制 netstd 软件包的使用范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:31:07Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/324","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0914"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0624","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0624.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0389","title":"Debian Linux 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Debian Linux netstd 软件包中的 bootp 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞触发缓冲区越界写入，导致系统崩溃或执行任意代码。受影响系统为运行 netstd 软件包的 Debian Linux 发行版，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限。成功利用后可获取目标系统的完全控制权，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0389"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-01-03T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 netstd 软件包至修复版本：Debian 2.0 (Hamm) 升级至 netstd 2.16-3 或更高版本，Debian 2.1 (Slink) 升级至 netstd 3.07-7.1.slink.1 或更高版本。如未使用 BOOTP 服务，建议禁用 bootpd 守护进程（注释 /etc/inetd.conf 中 bootps 行并重启 inetd），同时考虑迁移至 DHCP 替代已过时的 BOOTP 协议。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0624.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1511","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1511.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1422","title":"Slackware Slackware 默认PATH配置包含当前目录导致本地木马程序漏洞","description":"Slackware Linux 3.4 及部分其他版本的默认 PATH 环境变量中包含当前目录（`.`），导致本地用户可在共享目录中放置与系统命令同名的特洛伊木马程序。当其他用户（尤其是 root）进入该目录执行命令时，木马程序将被优先执行，从而造成权限提升。此漏洞利用条件较低，需攻击者具备本地访问权限并在目标用户可能经过的目录中预置恶意程序。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1422"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"移除环境变量 PATH 中的当前目录（.），编辑 /etc/profile 或 /etc/bashrc 等系统初始化文件，将 `PATH=\".:$PATH\"` 或 `PATH=\"$PATH:.\"` 改为 `PATH=\"/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin\"` 等不含点号的绝对路径；同时检查各用户家目录下的 .bashrc、.bash_profile、.profile 等文件，移除其中的点号路径项，修改后重新登录或执行 source 命令使配置生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91540043023167&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1422.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1422","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1422.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1422.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rmw5-mwqc-865c/GHSA-rmw5-mwqc-865c.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1422.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b0f02716-77e7-49e4-bf6b-e6a493fac3e1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/4e87ecc1abc33575c55e11407fc842c718c9d6cb/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b0f02716-77e7-49e4-bf6b-e6a493fac3e1.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1511.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1374","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1374.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1170","title":"Ipswitch IMail 权限提升漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 5.0 及 WS_FTP Server 1.0.1/1.0.2 存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过将注册表中 \"flags\" 键值设置为 1920，从而获取额外系统权限，进而修改或添加邮件账户。此漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，利用门槛较低，可导致未授权账户操作及系统配置篡改，影响邮件服务及 FTP 服务的正常安全运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1170"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:52Z","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.0 及以上版本，WS_FTP Server 升级至 2.0 及以上版本。同时使用 regedit 限制注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\...\\flags 的写入权限，仅允许 Administrators 组修改，并移除普通用户的写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=91816507920544&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/218","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1170.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1170","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1170.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1170.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ppp7-2732-7vj2/GHSA-ppp7-2732-7vj2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1170.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/218/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000483.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d6888d56-c1b0-4ee0-94e9-80ee70282bd4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0642","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0642.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0402","title":"GNU Wget 符号链接权限修改漏洞","description":"wget 1.5.3 在处理文件权限修改时存在符号链接跟随漏洞。当 wget 使用 chmod 修改下载文件的权限时，如果目标路径是一个符号链接，wget 会错误地跟随该链接并修改链接指向的实际文件的权限，而非符号链接本身的权限。攻击者可以在目标目录中预先创建指向敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd）的符号链接，诱使 wget 修改这些文件的权限，导致本地权限提升或敏感文件被非授权访问。该漏洞影响所有使用 wget 1.5.3 的用户，攻击条件为攻击者需在目标目录有写权限以创建符号链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0402"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-01-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 wget 1.6 及以上版本，该版本已修复符号链接跟随问题。对于无法升级的系统，应避免在不可信目录中使用 wget 下载文件，或在使用前手动检查目标路径是否存在符号链接。作为临时缓解措施，可在下载前清理目标目录中的未知符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0402","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0402"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0642.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1554","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1568","title":"NcFTPd FTP Server PORT命令长参数越界拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NcFTPd FTP Server 2.4.1 之前版本中存在差一错误（Off-by-one）漏洞，远程攻击者通过向 FTP 服务器发送特制的超长 PORT 命令参数，可触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NcFTPd 2.4.1 之前所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，仅需目标开放 FTP 端口即可实施。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1568"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:44Z","remediation":"立即将 NcFTPd 升级至 2.4.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 PORT 命令长参数导致的 off-by-one 越界写入问题。如无法升级，可在防火墙或 TCP Wrappers 中限制可连接 FTP 服务的源 IP 范围，降低远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91981352617720&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12699","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1833","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1568.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1568","https://github.com/kenhuangus/llm-wiki/blob/d2bd485921f6c7b6071afbb389f44ab8e4e83c69/wiki/security/cve/cve-1999-1568.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2658816172d77941b1080be8784997934e564ee9/SSVC/data/1999/CVE-1999-1568.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1568.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xcmq-73gm-f83r/GHSA-xcmq-73gm-f83r.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1568.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1518","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1518.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1430","title":"Royal daVinci PIM 数据库未授权访问漏洞","description":"Royal DaVinci PIM 软件在存储数据时使用 Microsoft Access 的 .mdb 文件，但未对文件进行有效的密码保护。本地攻击者可通过直接使用其他应用程序（如 Microsoft Access）打开 .mdb 文件，绕过密码验证读取其中敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Royal DaVinci 系列产品，攻击者需具备本地文件访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1430"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:25Z","remediation":"立即将 Royal daVinci 数据库文件（.mdb）存放目录的 NTFS 权限设置为仅允许授权用户访问，移除 Everyone 和 Users 组的读取权限。同时启用 Access 数据库文件密码保护（工具 → 安全 → 设置数据库密码），并升级到官方修复此问题的最新版本。如已停止维护，建议迁移至支持加密存储的替代 PIM 方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91540043723185&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/185","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1430.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1430","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1430.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1430.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-527c-cp3w-hxwj/GHSA-527c-cp3w-hxwj.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/185/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1430.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/62a8c583731615d6914ea6a751d3034ea83cc12f/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1518.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0991","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0991.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0665","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 注册表不当配置安全漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 中存在一个与系统关键注册表项相关的安全漏洞：某个对系统安全至关重要的注册表键值被设置为不恰当的数值。攻击者若能够访问或修改该注册表项（通常需要本地或远程获得相应权限，或通过其他漏洞达成注册表写入），即可使系统关键安全配置失效，进而破坏系统完整性、提升权限或绕过安全控制。该漏洞影响运行 Microsoft Windows NT 操作系统的相关版本，CVSS 基础评分达 10.0（满分），危害等级为严重，可能导致系统被完全控制。建议尽快检查并修正相关注册表键值，将不当配置恢复为厂商推荐的安全默认值。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0665"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Windows 2000 或更高版本操作系统，Windows NT 4.0 已于 2004 年停止支持。如无法升级，在注册表编辑器中检查 HKLM\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run 等关键键值的 ACL 权限，移除 Everyone 组的写入权限，并启用 Windows NT 的 ACL 审核策略监控注册表变更。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0665","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0665.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0665.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0665","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e54d5f68d5b83411d51ab3df8f5c1b120360f139/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0665.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0665.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xcr6-jvwv-gjvg/GHSA-xcr6-jvwv-gjvg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0665.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86265/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153200_153300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0991.toml"}]